From 9e46030a55e480d6a68a3a24dae51af887035e27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 02:35:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] app: disable the startup update check (no phone-home to
 api.github.com)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Crush launches `go app.checkForUpdates(ctx)` unconditionally in App.New,
which GETs https://api.github.com/repos/charmbracelet/crush/releases/latest
on every startup (internal/update/update.go). That is unsolicited outbound
traffic the runCrushInContainer client should never make — the project is
privacy-conscious and airgap-oriented, and on an airgapped box the check just
times out after 30s in a background goroutine.

Remove the launch. checkForUpdates (and update.Check) are left defined but
uncalled — an unused method is legal Go, so this stays a minimal, one-site
patch that is trivial to re-verify on a CRUSH_TAG bump. Any user-initiated
update path is unaffected; only the automatic startup check is disabled.

Carried as a local patch for runCrushInContainer, applied unconditionally at
image-build time (no build flag — a runCrush client never wants this check).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 internal/app/app.go | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/internal/app/app.go b/internal/app/app.go
index a19cfe4..2c8ae58 100644
--- a/internal/app/app.go
+++ b/internal/app/app.go
@@ -135,8 +135,12 @@ func New(ctx context.Context, conn *sql.DB, store *config.ConfigStore, skillsMgr
 		slog.Warn("Clipboard initialization failed", "error", err)
 	}
 
-	// Check for updates in the background.
-	go app.checkForUpdates(ctx)
+	// Update check DISABLED for runCrushInContainer: no unsolicited egress to
+	// api.github.com on startup (see tasks/disable-crush-telemetry.md). The
+	// checkForUpdates method is left defined (an unused method is legal Go) so
+	// this patch stays a one-line removal of the launch, easy to re-verify on a
+	// CRUSH_TAG bump.
+	_ = app.checkForUpdates
 
 	// Arm initialization synchronously before launching it so WaitForInit
 	// blocks for the in-flight init instead of racing the goroutine and
-- 
2.55.0

